{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/c60cf17345a8c077c295de21a3818be5.avif?t=1725016510\" width=568 height=113 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Space Colonialisation has just begun, Commander!:</h2><br><br>Conquer the stars in this simple but catchy multiplayer real-time strategy game from the creators of First Strike and become a Stellar Commander!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/37674990451d729bc6948cfbfa0f63e7.poster.avif?t=1725016510\" width=568 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/37674990451d729bc6948cfbfa0f63e7.webm?t=1725016510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/37674990451d729bc6948cfbfa0f63e7.mp4?t=1725016510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Stellar Commanders is a fast-paced <strong>multiplayer real-time strategy game</strong> that pits player against player in a bid to take control of distant planets as part of an inter-galactic war for precious resources. <br><br>The speedy 1 vs 1 battles will see each player align with a different faction and choose units based on a deep roster of unlockable futuristic troops; from rockets, tanks and stealth generators to bombastic orbital satellites, all of which will help determine tactical decisions.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/0f4194ed45083b6714862f67fe242a0f.avif?t=1725016510\" width=568 height=121 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your faction:</h2><br><br>Select your faction, but choose wisely. Will it be the radicalised bright minds of the <strong>Sons and Daughters of Barovia</strong>, the land grabbing old guard of the <strong>United Coalition of the World</strong> or the technologically advanced, traditionalist mega-corporation that is the <strong>Jin Guo Empire</strong>?<br><br>Each faction comes with their own unique units and strategies and their own tech trees of new units to unlock! Custimize your arsenal and become the best commander of your faction!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/e9bda00cafe0417fc24ef9c37ea87384.poster.avif?t=1725016510\" width=568 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/e9bda00cafe0417fc24ef9c37ea87384.webm?t=1725016510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/e9bda00cafe0417fc24ef9c37ea87384.mp4?t=1725016510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>This is our first multiplayer strategy game and one that we\u2019ve been excited about for some time \u2013 it seemed like a perfect next step after the huge success of First Strike. Combining the First Strike community\u2019s feedback about making a multiplayer strategy title with our own love of \u201890s RTS games has resulted in Stellar Commanders, which will have all the fast-paced fun of a modern, tactical RTS as well as a touch of nostalgia.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/dd33f015ce12dbb9cb4c69768fb3cb9d.poster.avif?t=1725016510\" width=568 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/dd33f015ce12dbb9cb4c69768fb3cb9d.webm?t=1725016510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165400/extras/dd33f015ce12dbb9cb4c69768fb3cb9d.mp4?t=1725016510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You will get the original First Strike experience in Multiplayer. Play against your friends in this stellar real-time strategy game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Real Time Multiplayer:</strong> Play strategy matches against real opponents or the AI.<br></li><li> <strong>Fast paced and Quick:</strong> A round of Stellar Commanders is 7 minutes max.<br></li><li> <strong>Planet Battle Maps:</strong> Play on tiny planets for supremacy.<br></li><li> <strong>Multiple factions:</strong> Join a faction with their own exclusive units and strategies.<br></li><li> <strong>Over 40 units:</strong> Unlock new units as you fulfill small micro missions for your faction.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f26de7f7cf8a43a51fe5eabb0b022fd484334791.jpg","localized_name":"Armored Troop Carrier","name":"Armored Troop Carrier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165400/f26de7f7cf8a43a51fe5eabb0b022fd484334791.jpg"},{"icon":"55161cd9ad29d350e31a4750aeca5fee42c7e543.jpg","localized_name":"Loviatar Cobalt Missile","name":"Loviatar Cobalt Missile","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165400/55161cd9ad29d350e31a4750aeca5fee42c7e543.jpg"},{"icon":"a239ca80869dde3efe5d92aaa223ce3dd395d0dc.jpg","localized_name":"Miasma Cobalt Spire","name":"Miasma Cobalt Spire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165400/a239ca80869dde3efe5d92aaa223ce3dd395d0dc.jpg"},{"icon":"7a1606f7e6eccb9a3887a13728e9d158ced6de33.jpg","localized_name":"Ursus Defense Turret","name":"Ursus Defense Turret","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165400/7a1606f7e6eccb9a3887a13728e9d158ced6de33.jpg"},{"icon":"50dd76221eb3bec1601378faca73e3a774b4931f.jpg","loca